/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26472455","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145#issuecomment-26472455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145","id":26472455,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NDcyNDU1","user":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-17T01:10:32Z","updated_at":"2013-10-17T01:10:32Z","body":"I just tried it with PHP 5.4.20, and a fresh installation of pear.  Seemed to go okay, except I had to remember to start a new command shell between installing pear, and attempting to install cakephp.\n\nThe cake.bat in the php5.4.20 directory from a pear install is a match for the Vendor/pear-pear.cakephp.org/CakePHP/bin/cake.bat, which just calls php, and does not have an issue.\n\nThere does not seem to be a match for the Vendor/bin/cake.bat that seems to be generated from the initial \"php composer.phar install\" command.\n\nPerhaps Vendor/bin/cake.bat is auto generated from Composer, because it has no headings. In fact, here's the contents, just in case you might recognise them somewhere else.\n\n```\n@echo off\npushd .\ncd %~dp0\ncd \"../pear-pear.cakephp.org/CakePHP/bin\"\nset BIN_TARGET=%CD%\\cake\npopd\ncmd /C \"%BIN_TARGET%\" %*\n```\n\nI've altered the last line from bash to cmd /C\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26472455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26472625","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145#issuecomment-26472625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145","id":26472625,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NDcyNjI1","user":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-17T01:15:48Z","updated_at":"2013-10-17T01:15:48Z","body":"Perhaps this is a composer installation issue then? There isn't much we can do about how composer generates bin stubs from our pear packages, at least not that I know of.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26472625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26473645","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145#issuecomment-26473645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145","id":26473645,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NDczNjQ1","user":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-17T01:45:30Z","updated_at":"2013-10-17T01:48:50Z","body":"I think it might be a composer feature, but there might be something that CakePHP can do to fix it for Windows users.\n\nhttp://getcomposer.org/doc/articles/vendor-binaries.md#what-about-windows-and-bat-files-\n\nThe .bat files in Vendor/bin would appear to be auto generated, and deliberately Unix-style, even though bash will break for installations not using Cygwin or Git (or not having Git integrated with the cmd).\n\nHowever, if Windows users were to use \"Vendor/bin/cake.php bake project <path to project>\", this will run pure php, without needing bash or cmd.\n\nI couldn't find a composer.json for master or 2.5, but in 3.0 the composer.json has a bin that specifies Cake/Console/cake.  It might also be worth specifying Cake/Console/cake.bat, perhaps to prevent to auto generation of cake.bat.  A similar thing might be available for 2.5 (or 2.4.2), if there is a composer.json for the pear package, or a pear package hint that specifies binary files.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26473645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26518691","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145#issuecomment-26518691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145","id":26518691,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NTE4Njkx","user":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-17T15:44:57Z","updated_at":"2013-10-17T15:44:57Z","body":"The pear package does not include a composer.json file, as composer creates a package definition from the pear manifest.\n\nWe could change the documentation around which command windows users should use as well.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26518691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26559620","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145#issuecomment-26559620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2145","id":26559620,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2NTU5NjIw","user":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-17T22:48:44Z","updated_at":"2013-10-17T22:48:44Z","body":"Looking at the pear/.registry/.channel.pear.cakephp.org/cakephp.reg, I can see that bin/cake, bin/cake.bat and bin/cake.php are all identified with a role of script.  Now the warning I saw when doing the install makes sense.  Composer is copying the scripts from the manifest, and generating a Windows version, one after the other.  \n\nSo, it first copies bin/cake, then generated bin/cake.bat, then attempts to copy bin/cake.bat, but fails because a file with that name already exists.  And then it continues with bin/cake.php, and generates bin/cake.php.bat.\n\nThis is definitely a Composer issue, as users should be able to override a Windows specific .bat, if they desire.  I'll go and post an issue for that on the Composer site.\n\nI will still recommend specifying cake.bat in the composer.json for CakePHP 3.0, so that it has been identified as a script and gets copied accordingly when Composer does its installation.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26559620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rhelms","id":815879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTg3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/815879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms","html_url":"https://github.com/rhelms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhelms/gists{/gis